our hearts, just like the sun!

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:22.310
Another new circuit appeared!

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:27.790
We're approaching the 
final stages of our goal.

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:32.000
Keep winning, Team 5D's.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:39.520
By doing so, our plan will be completed during 
your championship match against Team New World.

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:56.030
